SPEC = {"beats": [{"key": "all", "vo": "Heat stroke just dropped this runner a hundred meters from the finish line. He's confused, and his skin is burning hot. So does the medical team rush him to the hospital? NOT yet. A rectal thermometer reads about a hundred and seven degrees, and every minute it stays that high, his brain and organs take more damage. [serious] So they cool him first, right HERE, in a tub of ice water up to his neck. Within about fifteen minutes his temperature is dropping fast, and he's starting to make sense again. Once he's down near a hundred and two, he goes to the hospital. COOL first... then transport."}]}
